  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "PortraitCraft",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tPortraitCraft\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\u26a0\ufe0f This dataset is for non-commercial academic evaluation purposes only.  Commercial use is strictly prohibited .\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nPortraitCraft is a benchmark dataset for portrait composition understanding and portrait composition generation. It is designed to support models in learning and evaluating composition quality in portrait images. The dataset focuses on images with humans as the main subjects and includes a wide range of scenarios\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/zijielou/PortraitCraft.",
